{
  "$about": "Hand-kept, reviewed in PRs. Names agents reach for that do not exist here, and retired names, each with what to use instead. The one source of retired component names: a row marked retired is banned by npm run check:ads-language, and inProse also bans it from component doc prose (a rename with no alias), so retiring a component is one row here. Retired token names are the token plan's (scripts/lib/tokens/plan.mjs, ADR-038); the DS facts module lists them beside these rows, and a token row here that covers a retired name may offer only what the plan maps it to (scripts/lib/retired-names.test.mjs). Rendered into the header of agent-views/components/index.md by npm run generate:agent; every target must exist in components.json or tokens.json (scripts/lib/inventions.test.mjs).",
